    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000rl8b](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000rl8b) Magnitude 5.5 earthquake at 56.118 depth occurred on Nov 03 2025 138 km E of Ozernovskiy, Russia. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 51.6697 longitude 158.4792. It impacted 24 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
